      "summaries": {
        "en": "Penpot is an open-source design and prototyping platform that bridges the gap between designers and developers. Built on web standards like SVG and CSS, it enables real-time collaboration without proprietary formats. Its key strength lies in using Clojure for backend and ClojureScript for frontend, ensuring performance and extensibility. You can self-host it, integrate with version control, or use it as a Figma alternative for team projects.",
        "zh": "Penpot 是一款开源的设计与原型工具，旨在打破设计师与开发者之间的协作壁垒。它基于 SVG 和 CSS 等开放网页标准，无需专有格式即可实现实时协作。技术亮点在于采用 Clojure 构建后端、ClojureScript 构建前端，保证了高性能与可扩展性。你可以自行部署，与版本控制系统集成，或将其作为 Figma 的替代品用于团队项目。其设计文件本质上是标准网页代码，开发者可直接复用，极大简化了设计到开发的交接流程。",
        "es": "Penpot is an open-source design and prototyping platform that bridges the gap between designers and developers. Built on web standards like SVG and CSS, it enables real-time collaboration without proprietary formats. Its key strength lies in using Clojure for backend and ClojureScript for frontend, ensuring performance and extensibility. You can self-host it, integrate with version control, or use it as a Figma alternative for team projects.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "penpot stands out for clojure, clojurescript, and design in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Penpot is an open-source design and prototyping platform that bridges the gap between designers and developers. Built on web standards like SVG and CSS, it enables real-time collaboration without proprietary formats. Its key strength lies in using Clojure for backend and ClojureScript for frontend, ensuring performance and extensibility. You can self-host it, integrate with version control, or use it as a Figma alternative for team projects.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/penpot/penpot for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
